{"unit_id":"Rexopia__dsh-plugin-knowra#card-zh","repo":"Rexopia/dsh-plugin-knowra","commit":"584d5e401908ea7d04b8f0642f2bc346d7995c8d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Knowra 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的 arXiv 论文检索和 Scout 报告插件。它通过 MCP 服务接入 DSH 工具系统，并在插件页提供账户连接界面。用户可以按主题、作者和日期搜索论文，查看论文的 Scout 方法、证据与局限报告，并查询使用额度；搜索无需登录，报告和额度查询需连接 Knowra 账户。连接时在浏览器完成 OAuth 授权，凭据由 DSH credential service 保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/bridge.ts:30-59","src/oauth.ts:9-12","src/client.tsx:80-93","src/index.ts:15-35"]}
{"unit_id":"Rexopia__dsh-plugin-knowra#card-en","repo":"Rexopia/dsh-plugin-knowra","commit":"584d5e401908ea7d04b8f0642f2bc346d7995c8d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Knowra connects DSH to arXiv search and Scout reports through MCP tools. Search papers by topic, author, or date without signing in; connect a Knowra account to read reports on methods, evidence, and limitations or check usage. The account page supports browser OAuth, and DSH stores the grant.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/bridge.ts:30-59","src/oauth.ts:9-12","src/client.tsx:80-93","src/index.ts:15-35"]}
